# Encrypt-to-model gateway (offline)
# Agent seals → gateway decrypts at model boundary → Bifrost when --live
# Off by default until gateway encrypt on + key.

crypto keygen -> key

encrypt gateway enable key

gateway encrypt on

encrypt seal text "SSN 123-45-6789 stays ciphertext on the wire" -> blob

encrypt open blob -> plain

print plain

model fast

ask "Reply with exactly: gateway-ok" -> reply

print reply

gateway encrypt off
